        <body>
            <div xml:id="d677">

                <pb facs="0167" n="1217" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v11p2/pg1217"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">357.AB/4–552: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Embassy in India</hi><anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d677-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >confidential<lb/>priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1952-04-05T17:05:00-05:00">April 5, 1952—5:05
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2128. Re Kashmir. Dept and Brit
                    Emb with UK FonOff approval are in agreement that the fol message shld be
                    conveyed by you to GOI (the UK High Commissioner
                    will receive similar instructions): <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>We understand that Dr. Graham
                            is returning to NY this weekend and we further understand that on
                            arrival before submitting any report, he wishes to hold further
                            discussions with the reps of the parties
                            in NY.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>We hope that the Govt of India, recognizing the great importance of
                            continuing their efforts to reach agreement, will be ready to resume
                            negots in this way, particularly in view of the advantage of avoiding
                            public debate at this stage.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Acheson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d677-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d677-f1-content">
                <p>This telegram was repeated for information to London and New York.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
